<span class="line"><span style="color:#E1E4E8;">    </span><span style="color:#85E89D;">driver-class-name</span><span style="color:#E1E4E8;">: </span><span style="color:#9ECBFF;">com.mysql.cj.jdbc.Driver</span></span>
